# Route: guide 5 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Undead (1199
# of 1215 eligible quests, 157.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 16 to 20, 45
# quests, 3.1 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Silverpine Forest, Undercity): The Sepulcher -> The Decrepit Ferry ->
# Olsen's Farthing -> The Greymane Wall -> Pyrewood Village -> Beren's Peril
# -> Ambermill -> The Sepulcher -> The Dead Field -> Malden's Orchard ->
# Ambermill -> The Sepulcher -> The Decrepit Ferry -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Arugal's Folly (99; Moonrage
# Watcher 13-14, Moonrage Sentry 14-15, Moonrage Elder 14-15, Moonrage Armorer
# 14-15, Moonrage Tailor 14-15, Moonrage Leatherworker 14-15); Pyrewood Ambush
# (452; Councilman Smithers 12); Whispering Horror Residue (95328; Whispering
# Horror 11-13).
#
# Left out: The Engraved Ring (440), The Lich's Identity (357): the route
# takes them here but cannot finish them (the coverage report's missed
# quests).
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 3526 Goblin
# Engineering; 3635 Gnome Engineering.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Arugal Must Die (1014), Arugal Must Die (1014), Into The
# Scarlet Monastery (1048), Deathstalkers in Shadowfang (1098), Deathstalkers
# in Shadowfang (1098), The Power to Destroy... (5725), The New Plague
# (95216), Heart of Disruption (96984), Source of Power (96988), The Book of
# Ur (1013), The Book of Ur (1013), Going, Going, Guano! (1109), Going, Going,
# Guano! (1109), Bring the End (3341), The Power to Destroy... (5725), Light's
# Justice (92421), Light's Justice (92421), The New Plague (95216), Source of
# Power (96988).

